5a56fbde: ;
; DGJTHLP1 - Help Text Processing Module 1
;
; This module is responsible for processing and displaying
; help text for the DGJT application. It includes functions
; for loading, formatting, and presenting help content to
; the user.
;

d21146c6: ;
; CEHLPTXT - Continuing Education Help Text
;
; Provides detailed help text related to continuing education
; modules. This includes instructions, guidelines, and FAQs
; to assist users in navigating and completing CE modules.
;

5a6cd5c5: ;
; CIHLPTXT - Clinical Information Help Text
;
; Contains help text and documentation aimed at clinicians,
; covering topics such as patient information management,
; clinical guidelines, and use of clinical software tools.
;

c5cd45a0: ;
; VWHLPTXT - Viewer Help Text
;
; Offers help and guidance on using the viewer tool within
; the application. This includes navigation, interpreting
; data, and customizing the view for optimal user experience.
;

0dc207ab: ;
; ADHLPTXT - Administrative Help Text
;
; Provides support and instructions for administrative tasks
; within the application, including user management, data
; reporting, and system settings adjustments.
;
